@startuml Architecture

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FDFDFD
skinparam StateBorderColor #333333
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
hide empty description

' Definisi State
state "Idle (Home)" as Idle
state "Camera Preview" as Cam
state "Processing OCR" as OCR
state "Semantic Analysis" as Sem
state "Translating" as Trans
state "Show Result" as Res
state "Error Handler" as Err

' Definisi Logic Gate (Diamond Shape)
' Ini adalah titik KRUSIAL untuk Proof di Lean 4
state c_ocr <<Choice>>
state c_sem <<Choice>>

' Alur Diagram
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Cam : User Clicks Scan

Cam --> OCR : Image Captured
Cam --> Idle : Back Button

OCR --> c_ocr : Extraction Done
' Logic Gate 1: Cek apakah OCR menghasilkan teks?
c_ocr --> Sem : [Text.Length > 0]
c_ocr --> Err : [Text Empty / Null]

Sem --> c_sem : Analysis Done
' Logic Gate 2: Cek apakah kalimatnya masuk akal?
c_sem --> Trans : [Is Meaningful Text]
c_sem --> Err : [Is Gibberish / Noise]

Trans --> Res : API Success
Trans --> Err : Network Timeout

Err --> Idle : Show Alert & Reset
Res --> Idle : Close Result
@enduml